  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.0 replaces official 009 Dual Blader with a native-contract Yone: alternating steel/Azakana attacks, hit-gated two-stage Q, crowd-control-gated W pursuit, and a safe six-slash R with one final fixed-damage soul echo. It includes independent ImageGen actor, Q/W/R VFX, icons, compact/grid/full-body portraits, Ban/Pick illustration and pinned local official ability audio while preserving all 13 official animation tags, frame rectangles and timings. Also includes the existing Rift quality pack, deterministic elemental drakes and League-style UI/audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
